You compare gold reference statements with candidate statements from a credit report. A gold statement counts as present if its content and its key numbers are jointly covered by one or more of the listed candidate facts; several candidates may each state a part. The candidates together must not contradict the gold statement or change a number. For every gold id answer with the list of candidate fact ids that cover it, or an empty list when it is not covered. The gold id is the bare number after GOLD, for example "0".

Reply with one JSON value only, minified on a single line: no indentation, no line breaks between tokens, no prose, no Markdown code fences. The value must conform to this JSON schema:
{"$defs":{"MatchDecision":{"description":"The judge's answer for one gold fact: the covering fact ids, empty when unmatched.","properties":{"gold_id":{"title":"Gold Id","type":"string"},"fact_ids":{"items":{"type":"string"},"title":"Fact Ids","type":"array"}},"required":["gold_id"],"title":"MatchDecision","type":"object"}},"description":"The model reply for one batch of gold facts.","properties":{"matches":{"items":{"$ref":"#/$defs/MatchDecision"},"title":"Matches","type":"array"}},"title":"MatchOutput","type":"object"}

